From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil Reif <pr@sambal.net>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:34:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: link rooms with #name autocomplete and room chips

Typing #name in the composer offers the server's rooms and inserts a
plain Markdown link [#name](<origin>/chat/<server>/<roomId>), so clients
without this feature still see a working link. Rendered room links show
the current room name as a chip; links to rooms the viewer cannot see
become a non-clickable "unknown room" chip. Frontend only.
